                                                "sense_id": "abcfcd58-c2b7-3193-84fd-05a18fb1887d",
                                                "text": "Government of the Tongue\nLet not those that have repudiated the more inviting sins, shew themselves philtred and bewitched."
                                            }
                                        ]
